# Fuzzel Fobble (raylib) — the compilation unit.
#
# Used by run.sh (`fcc @demos/fuzzel-fobble-raylib/lsp.rsp`) and discovered by
# `fcc --lsp` so the editor resolves names exactly the way the build does.
# Paths are relative to this file.
#
# Note what is *not* here: ../shared/sdl2.fc. This demo is the raylib half of
# the SDL2-vs-raylib comparison, so it shares everything with
# demos/fuzzel-fobble except the platform layer.

../shared/raylib.fc
../shared/opl2.fc
../shared/opl_audio.fc
sound.fc
main.fc

# Selects opl_audio's raylib device backend over its default SDL one. Without
# this the audio engine's Device section would want sdl2.fc.
--flag raylib_audio

# stdlib modules this demo imports
../../stdlib/io.fc
../../stdlib/text.fc
../../stdlib/sys.fc
../../stdlib/math.fc
../../stdlib/random.fc
